# Terraform Makefile for form-to-1milion

This Makefile provides shortcuts for common Terraform operations.

## Usage

### Initialize Terraform

```bash
make init
# or
make format
```

### Plan Infrastructure

```bash
make plan
```

### Apply Infrastructure

```bash
make apply
```

### Destroy Infrastructure

```bash
make destroy
```

### Format Code

```bash
make fmt
```

### Validate Configuration

```bash
make validate
```

### View Outputs

```bash
make output
```

### Build and Push Docker Images

```bash
make build-images
```

### Get Specific Outputs

```bash
make output-api-url      # API Load Balancer URL
make output-db-endpoint  # RDS Endpoint
make output-sqs-url      # SQS Queue URL
make output-cluster      # ECS Cluster Name
```

### View Logs

```bash
make logs-api     # Tail API logs
make logs-worker  # Tail Worker logs
make logs-all     # Tail all logs
```

### Terraform State Management

```bash
make state-list      # List resources in state
make state-show      # Show specific resource
make state-refresh   # Refresh state from AWS
```

### Cleanup

```bash
make clean           # Remove plan files
make full-clean      # Remove all generated files
```

## All Available Targets

See the Makefile for complete list of targets and their descriptions.
